{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "d08b3c8b-a3a8-567d-874e-b774e0a7be53", "source_ordinal": 1480, "reading_ordinal": 2577, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "长兄如父", "published_at": "2024-07-09T12:17:04+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/660341866/answer/3556211360"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "如果你有这种困扰，你就很难做些什么。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "因为中国的传统经验是将长子长女作为家庭领袖培养，理所当然的对长子女赋予管理所有弟妹的制度性权力。", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 67}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "在这个安排下，弟弟妹妹争吵的目标会是你，因为父母会很少直接管理弟弟妹妹，所以恶人一直是你，而父母可以一直当好人，出来处理申诉、主持公道。", "char_start": 68, "char_end": 136}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "而相对于这份责任，父母会给长子长女无条件的优待支持（尤其是长子）。", "char_start": 137, "char_end": 170}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "买块蛋糕，是交给长子来分给弟妹，并且理所当然长子要拿最大的的一块。", "char_start": 171, "char_end": 204}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "有机会，很自然安排长子先得。", "char_start": 205, "char_end": 219}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "家业干脆就默认是长子继承，只是长子要承担给弟弟妹妹的基本生活保底、做他们终身的最终庇护者。", "char_start": 220, "char_end": 265}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这种安排也会给长子和弟弟妹妹们大量的学习领导和被领导的经验，既为家业准备了继承人，也为家族的次子次女们向外发展准备了良好的基础——因为ta们不能继承家产，所以一开始就要准备从一名优秀的下属先做起，去赢得外在强大力量的认可和倚重。", "char_start": 266, "char_end": 380}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "在这个家庭伦理安排下，长兄长姊对弟弟妹妹有不可质疑的第一处置权和管理权，你自然会有充分的权柄和资格去干预弟弟妹妹的行为。", "char_start": 381, "char_end": 441}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "问题是，这个安排在现代——尤其是经过几代的独生子女政策的影响——基本“失传”了。", "char_start": 442, "char_end": 482}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "现在变成了一旦生了一堆小孩，父母们会下意识的模仿美式家庭，全都自己直接管，而且会极为愚蠢的、天真的、轻率的尝试在所有子女中搞所谓的“平等”、“民主”。", "char_start": 483, "char_end": 558}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "长幼之分仅仅只在年龄，长子没有任何正式的权柄，只有父母胡乱安排的责任，事情大哥不能决定，出了事却怪大哥没照顾好。", "char_start": 559, "char_end": 615}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "长子没跟弟弟妹妹反目成仇已经是上天对愚蠢的父母格外怜悯了。", "char_start": 616, "char_end": 645}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "大多数家庭甚至根本就没有这种运气，也的确兄弟姐妹之间就反目成仇了，区别只是有没有公开翻脸而已。", "char_start": 646, "char_end": 693}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "既然你在迷惑能做什么，就意味着你家里这个制度已经废除、失传，你的父母没有这个足够明确的结构制度的意识。而在ta们没这个意识、没给你极为严肃的长子权力、没有以恰当的长子待遇来补偿你的额外负担的前提下，客观上你没有资源和能力做传统长子长兄所能做的干预。", "char_start": 694, "char_end": 818}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你能做的，其实没比ta们的好友、同学多多少。也无非是帮ta们求求情，时不时打打气而已。", "char_start": 819, "char_end": 862}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这不是你的错误，也不是你的责任，你不必背太多思想包袱。", "char_start": 863, "char_end": 890}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "真正做出错误安排的是父母，ta们左支右绌狼狈不堪的现在，只是ta们抗拒自然法则的自然惩戒。", "char_start": 891, "char_end": 936}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "但严肃地讲，这个积重难返，十几年前就不该走上现在这条路，现在临时想变轨已经晚了。", "char_start": 937, "char_end": 977}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "哪怕是你干预和影响弟弟妹妹的能力，也是要靠十来年的长兄管理权倒实践和无数次的复盘、再裁决来打磨才能有的。你现在就是有心、父母就是现在给你这权利，你也因为没有这十年之功而难以运用，所以说现在这个阶段，客观上已经无法支持这个解法了。", "char_start": 978, "char_end": 1092}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "现实点说，现在你现在只能看紧点，防止最坏的结果，等到弟妹上学离家，等待“距离产生美”吧。", "char_start": 1093, "char_end": 1137}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 21}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0377"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：家中的兄弟姐妹经常和父母发生争吵和冲突，甚至有自杀／自残倾向，作为年长的孩子可以做些什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021"], "summary": "围绕“长兄如父”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“如果你有这种困扰，你就很难做些什么。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "如果你有这种困扰，你就很难做些什么。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "4ce249c1-9502-5163-a6be-9fe8c2c029a6", "source_ordinal": 1479, "reading_ordinal": 2578, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "绕道而行", "published_at": "2024-07-09T13:45:21+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/575900734/answer/3556302463"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "当你看到一种信号的时候，一定要道歉。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "那就是你发现有人明明在做一件ta完全有权利做的事情，却拼命要瞒着你。", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 53}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "因为这意味着你的愚蠢、脆弱和贪婪已经对别人的自由构成了严重的威胁。", "char_start": 54, "char_end": 87}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你已经在享受别人对你愚蠢的妥协和让步。", "char_start": 88, "char_end": 107}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "如果对方发现你已经观察到这个迹象却不道歉，你在对方眼里就再也不是一个正常、完整、有资格得到尊重的人。", "char_start": 108, "char_end": 158}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "因为你确实不是。", "char_start": 159, "char_end": 167}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 7}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0377"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：爸妈瞒着我和我妹，生的三胎被我们知道了，现在事情发展不可控，该怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006"], "summary": "围绕“绕道而行”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“当你看到一种信号的时候，一定要道歉。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "当你看到一种信号的时候，一定要道歉。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "7ed41d31-80e8-5271-a9e4-28fb09f71d48", "source_ordinal": 1478, "reading_ordinal": 2579, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "隐瞒债务", "published_at": "2024-07-11T04:24:04+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/279623029/answer/3558087311"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "你没有签字且没有用于家庭生活、资产配置的债务，你不需要承担赔偿。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 32}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "离婚，在排除家庭财产中的“有毒部分”之后，切割共同财产，让他拿自己的份额去归还。", "char_start": 33, "char_end": 73}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这其实是法律上的标准操作。", "char_start": 74, "char_end": 87}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "不必考虑“如何保住夫妻感情”“如何保住婚姻”的问题。", "char_start": 88, "char_end": 114}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "因为其实只有极为积极的配合你完成这种分割，主动的、让你毫无困扰的、公平的承担他带来的灾难，尽全力保护无辜的你，他才有机会真的赢得你的热情。", "char_start": 115, "char_end": 184}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "也就是必须置之死地而后生。", "char_start": 185, "char_end": 198}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "而他这样做的结果很自然就是“离婚离得非常干脆和顺畅”。", "char_start": 199, "char_end": 226}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "任何导致离婚、财产分割的过程有波折的行为，都会导致这份感情受到毁灭性的、单方面无法抵挡的打击。", "char_start": 227, "char_end": 274}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "换言之，这时候保护感情的机会几乎完全在他那边。", "char_start": 275, "char_end": 298}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "要复合，也要先离了再重新谈。", "char_start": 299, "char_end": 313}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "Burn it to the ground so that it can grow back again.", "char_start": 314, "char_end": 367}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这实际上是解决大多数感情无法承受的极限挑战的唯一正道——它不指向必然重生，但恰恰是断然的接受这个极端的风险，是你能有的最大的机会。", "char_start": 368, "char_end": 433}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "任何别的扯淡都只会缩小、折损这个机会。", "char_start": 434, "char_end": 453}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "人们之所以宁可冒着折损感情、断绝重生的风险也要拼老命避免这个选择，恰恰不是因为ta们“重感情”，而是因为ta们在意自己的恐惧、自己的傲慢自我（ego）、自己的折磨，胜过了在意这份爱的幸存本身。", "char_start": 454, "char_end": 550}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "真正杀死这亲密联系的，恰恰是这种犹豫、诡诈、推脱背后这个“其实ta在乎自己的舒适安逸，胜过在乎这份感情”的真相。", "char_start": 551, "char_end": 607}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 15}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0377"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：老公突然告诉你欠巨额债务怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015"], "summary": "围绕“隐瞒债务”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“你没有签字且没有用于家庭生活、资产配置的债务，你不需要承担赔偿。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "你没有签字且没有用于家庭生活、资产配置的债务，你不需要承担赔偿。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 32, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "4317e268-6a1a-5c58-a3df-51ff7c71c5f8", "source_ordinal": 1477, "reading_ordinal": 2580, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "不可战胜的手工艺", "published_at": "2024-07-11T06:28:18+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/660887197/answer/3558107200"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "以下是几个一般策略：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "1）大胆打出“不完美”的牌。", "char_start": 11, "char_end": 25}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "大胆的利用缺口、裂痕、指印、不对称，不但不追求在完美性、精致性上超越工业品，还要反过来炫耀残缺和不完美，不以为耻，反以为荣。", "char_start": 26, "char_end": 88}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "2）引入有机结构、随意性来构建美感。", "char_start": 90, "char_end": 108}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "\n3）刻意的引入随机过程，接受高废品率，靠着自己的独特审美能力筛选产物。", "char_start": 109, "char_end": 145}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "烧箔", "char_start": 147, "char_end": 149}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "4）和机器结成盟友，大量引入半自动机械，把这些机械当作新的雕刀、画笔来创作。", "char_start": 150, "char_end": 188}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "谁说雕刀必须是铁刃？为什么不能是水刃、激光刃、超声波刀？", "char_start": 189, "char_end": 217}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "谁说锻打必须靠人力？为什么不能用电驱动锻打机？", "char_start": 218, "char_end": 241}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "实际上手工本来就不介意使用工具——传统玉雕大量的使用原始车床工具。", "char_start": 242, "char_end": 275}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "手工本来就可以从新的强大工具中受益。", "char_start": 276, "char_end": 294}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "5）直接使用自动工具为手工创作创造新材料。", "char_start": 295, "char_end": 316}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "3d打印布料", "char_start": 318, "char_end": 324}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "6）谁说手工操作一定意味着刀剪锤胶、金木泥石？", "char_start": 326, "char_end": 349}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "打不过巨人，意味着你应该让巨人为你而战。", "char_start": 351, "char_end": 371}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2024-07/10/50189e844bf4cd232cff593948e2de5b.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG002", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2024-07/10/aa1b6accf1598653ab0d59a62e0bfa49.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG003", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2024-07/10/4419fed26c2223d87c522f1a21fe1a23.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG004", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2024-07/10/d28b6f1f35cc3c887b6548a2664a025f.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG005", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2024-07/10/1929873e0a96496c4ad31e610e63ea77.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG006", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2024-07/10/94b28ca5db61c73f2b6e8373ecaf2c67.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG007", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2024-07/10/3fa196e749402bb26426ef949dd0e0bd.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 27, "image": 7}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0377"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：手工艺者将来如何和机器竞争？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015"], "summary": "围绕“不可战胜的手工艺”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“以下是几个一般策略：”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "以下是几个一般策略：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "7b1e50b9-eaef-5d1a-a140-5f775608e90c", "source_ordinal": 1476, "reading_ordinal": 2581, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "权利的游戏", "published_at": "2024-07-11T10:51:30+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/79a4af0e3f3011ef916152540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "下面这个策略，建议各位父母仔细的看清楚。仔细的想清楚，这跟你平时的“苦口婆心”“义正词严”有何不同。你能看得明白，举一反三，你的子女的将来自然光明。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 74}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "第一，这个头盔你要用自己的生活费托管账户支付。", "char_start": 75, "char_end": 98}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "第二，给你一个目录，这个目录里的品种是我给你挑好的、我肯定可以同意的型号，如果你选这些品种，一个盔补贴150元。", "char_start": 99, "char_end": 155}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "注意看清楚，每个价格都高于150元，你自己总是要出点。", "char_start": 156, "char_end": 183}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你可以给出需求，申请扩张选项，每增加一个选择手续费10元。", "char_start": 184, "char_end": 213}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "第三，超出这个范围，ta要选，可以。但是注意：", "char_start": 215, "char_end": 238}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "1）要求强制性满足特定的安全标准（给出安全规范编号）。", "char_start": 239, "char_end": 266}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "2）默认补贴只有100元。如果需要额外补贴（50元封顶），则需要你提交正式书面报告申请。申请可能不被批准。", "char_start": 267, "char_end": 320}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "3）提供申请撰写咨询服务，25元一次。不包过。", "char_start": 321, "char_end": 344}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "4）提供申请润色服务，10元一次。不包过。", "char_start": 345, "char_end": 366}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "第四，如果在选购期结束前，你没有提出合乎安全要求的选项，那就必须在指定选择中挑选一项。", "char_start": 368, "char_end": 411}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "以上所有费用可以用你的生活费账户余额来扣除。不足部分可以以你的生活费担保向我贷款，月利1%，每月自动从你的生活费账户扣除。", "char_start": 413, "char_end": 474}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "我要你选我挑的，是我花钱买到的权利。我对你的“强制性”体现在补贴的诱惑上。你的“独立精神”，请你体现在抗拒补贴的诱惑上。", "char_start": 476, "char_end": 536}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你的申请写得好，没准我会大幅的提高补贴和投资也说不定，那就看你的本事。", "char_start": 537, "char_end": 572}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "会利用系统服务也是本事之一。", "char_start": 573, "char_end": 587}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "自己的意志得以实现，是靠你自己hack整个系统，beat the game的结果，不是靠你跟我的“权利的对撞”。", "char_start": 588, "char_end": 644}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你没有“权利”，你只有“能力越强，结果越好”的机会。", "char_start": 645, "char_end": 671}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "不要提要求，也不要批评，创造服从可以获利、对抗会损失利润、成本可控的规则。", "char_start": 673, "char_end": 710}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 24}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0377"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：儿子要的东西和我意见产生分歧该怎么沟通？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018"], "summary": "围绕“权利的游戏”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“下面这个策略，建议各位父母仔细的看清楚。仔细的想清楚，这跟你平时的“苦口婆心”“义正词严”有何不同。你能看得明白，举一反三，你的子女的将来自然光明。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "下面这个策略，建议各位父母仔细的看清楚。仔细的想清楚，这跟你平时的“苦口婆心”“义正词严”有何不同。你能看得明白，举一反三，你的子女的将来自然光明。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 74, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "18b01445-6ff0-5286-965f-3f61b4edc413", "source_ordinal": 1475, "reading_ordinal": 2582, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "帮助明星", "published_at": "2024-07-12T07:13:02+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/648059525/answer/3559203967"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "1）取得个人的成功，然后归因于明星对自己的启发和激励。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 27}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这是最根本的一条——在对方的启发和激励下，你获得了更美好、更强健的人生和事业，其实是你投身支持对方的实际行动的基本条件。", "char_start": 28, "char_end": 88}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "注意，你决定支持的理由，不能是“得到了快感”、不是“为了对方的宠爱”，而必须是你因为对方所提供的服务，变得比之前更热爱生活、更积极乐观、而且的确在收入或者ta人对你的估值有明确提升。", "char_start": 89, "char_end": 180}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "只有你是在拿对方给你带来的收益的一部分来支持对方，这个支持才是本质健康的。", "char_start": 181, "char_end": 218}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "而在没有受益的前提下，纯拿自己的付出（无论是金钱还是时间）换取某种虚幻的快感，这在本质上只是在吸毒，必然是不健康的。", "char_start": 219, "char_end": 277}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这一条决定着要不要支持、该不该支持，只有这一条过了关，才有“如何最好的支持”的问题。", "char_start": 278, "char_end": 320}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这一条过不了关，你要寻求的是终止自己的迷恋，而不是什么“如何支持”。", "char_start": 321, "char_end": 355}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "2）在物质上直接帮助对方的事业——例如向对方主持的社会活动捐款，购买对方的产品，在自己的职权、专业方面为对方的事业提供合法的、积极的帮助。", "char_start": 356, "char_end": 425}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "3）帮助对方扩大影响，并且引导新来者正确的参与这个关系。", "char_start": 426, "char_end": 454}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "4）多帮对方制造朋友，少给对方制造敌人。", "char_start": 455, "char_end": 475}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 10}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0377"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：粉丝到底该如何支持自己的偶像才是最合适最理性的？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010"], "summary": "围绕“帮助明星”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“1）取得个人的成功，然后归因于明星对自己的启发和激励。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "1）取得个人的成功，然后归因于明星对自己的启发和激励。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 27, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "fedadbd7-2954-5679-ba74-564b76c57363", "source_ordinal": 1474, "reading_ordinal": 2583, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "生育抑郁", "published_at": "2024-07-12T14:52:13+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/449764a0401b11efaf5652540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "产后抑郁、孕期抑郁，在很大程度上是一个社会问题，而不是一个简单的生理问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 37}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "有一个很少被注意的问题，就是实际上生育女性的社会保障在现代是被实质性的削弱了，而不是增强了。", "char_start": 38, "char_end": 84}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "古代的离婚——休妻——和现代的离婚有一个非常大的区别，那就是古代休妻必然是女性离开家庭，子女一律继续跟随夫家生活。甚至如果是本家贫穷，将子女过继给家族亲戚，也会保持这些子嗣的父姓身份。极少有休妻后将该妻妾的子女归女性继续抚养的——除非该子女是出自婚外关系。", "char_start": 85, "char_end": 213}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "而相对的，离婚、弃养妻子的概率也极小，即使丧夫寡居，本族的寡妇也会由家族的公共支出提供照顾扶养。", "char_start": 214, "char_end": 262}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "换言之，女性一旦出嫁，就等于获得了一份由社会契约、传统伦理和道德舆论共同保证的“终身保障”。在自己不失德的前提下，男方如果“抛妻弃子”，会被宗族唾弃。而即使小家庭发生了变故，还有宗族接手。", "char_start": 263, "char_end": 357}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这是一个有“底”的生活，一个真正的“终身有靠”的心理状态——虽然有三从四德这类沉重的代价。", "char_start": 358, "char_end": 403}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "而现代呢？即使你结了婚、生了子，也存在很大的可能性会离婚——离婚率甚至高达几成。而离婚之后子女跟随母亲而父亲单身重新组织新家庭，甚至是概率更大的结果。", "char_start": 405, "char_end": 480}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "没有什么社会谴责——谁认识谁？", "char_start": 481, "char_end": 496}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "也没有什么“宗族接手”，宗族已经不存在了。", "char_start": 497, "char_end": 518}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "万一发生什么，就是女性自己孤独面对抚养的重担，男性只需要负担法定抚养费。", "char_start": 519, "char_end": 555}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "在最坏的局面下，父亲即使年入百万或者分了几百万家庭资产，也很可能通过种种手段做到只需要支付几千块抚养费就可以交代掉自己全部的抚养义务。", "char_start": 556, "char_end": 623}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "甚至，连这点钱都可以拖欠，或者逼着女方一次次来乞讨。", "char_start": 624, "char_end": 650}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "女方脚下是没有坚实的陆地的。", "char_start": 651, "char_end": 665}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这是一个“没底”的生活。", "char_start": 666, "char_end": 678}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "她在这段期间，唯一能抵抗对未知的恐怖想象的依靠就是你，你懂不懂？", "char_start": 679, "char_end": 711}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "只有你对她的痛苦连心连肝一般的感同身受、对她危难中哪怕最微小的需要都闪电般地坚决响应，才能让她有这个勇气去相信“未来应该不至于黑暗”“我可能幸运到不会遇到最坏的结果”。", "char_start": 712, "char_end": 796}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你不要觉得你是亏了，你在这个关键时期对她做的这些体贴、照顾，对她而言都是救她于水火般的恩情，得到的感激和眷恋要超过你平时的殷勤十倍百倍。", "char_start": 797, "char_end": 865}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "何况你如果是真的爱，你怎么可能不为她为你承受的这巨大的痛苦和恐惧感同身受、爱意翻涌？", "char_start": 866, "char_end": 908}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "她本来就自然而然应该感受到你向外辐射出的那种灼热的爱与眷恋。那用不着你有多伟大，仅仅只是“一个爱你的人为了你不惜冒死，在眼睁睁的忍受十个月的足以永久改变她的美貌和青春的生理折磨”这个残酷的安排带给你自己的折磨，就应该足以驱动你为了缓解自己的痛苦而去做这些服务了。", "char_start": 909, "char_end": 1040}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "坦白讲，我伺候你、照顾你，都可以说不是为了什么讨好你、安慰你，而是我自己想到、看到、感应到你的折磨，我自己就在痛苦，我自己就感到针扎般的折磨。你就是我的伤口本身，我是在通过缓解你的痛苦、慰藉你的折磨，给我自己的痛苦上药、缓解我自己目睹爱人为我牺牲的折磨而已。", "char_start": 1041, "char_end": 1170}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "这才是她真正要的安慰——她能看到她因爱而受的痛苦折磨能借由爱的存在自动的传递到你的灵魂和肉体，你永远也不是她的痛苦的局外人、旁观者。这样，她才会相信你不会坐视她的痛苦和折磨于不顾。你所有的力有未逮，因为她确信这份感应痛的存在，都可以被她接受为“确实尽力了但解决不了”的结果而得到原谅和心疼。", "char_start": 1171, "char_end": 1316}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "因为你也在痛，你不是无痛的，因此你不会有力可用而不用。", "char_start": 1317, "char_end": 1344}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "但如果她在这时看到她的痛苦哪怕行诸于色，你也仿佛毫无感受；她的折磨哪怕诉诸于口，你也仿佛事不关己；你要她在这时“不要抑郁”，要怪她“小题大做”耽误自己打游戏，实在是……", "char_start": 1345, "char_end": 1429}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "唉。", "char_start": 1430, "char_end": 1432}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "唉…………", "char_start": 1433, "char_end": 1438}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "唉！", "char_start": 1439, "char_end": 1441}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "写不下去了，抱歉。", "char_start": 1443, "char_end": 1452}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "你们tm的长点心吧。", "char_start": 1454, "char_end": 1464}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "唉。", "char_start": 1465, "char_end": 1467}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "实在讲，只有彼此相爱才是平安度过生育抑郁的最有力凭借。娘家的支撑——也就是父母的爱——可以作为有力的补充，但那些会产生这抑郁的姑娘们大概是没有这根保险绳的。", "char_start": 1469, "char_end": 1547}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "可以的话，你最好还是把这几千个答案看完，然后去找到懂得爱也和你相爱的人，为他去迎接这个折磨。", "char_start": 1548, "char_end": 1594}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "有这个前提，这个折磨反而会因为得到回应而成为他爱你的铁证，不但不会让你抑郁，反而会带给你足以战胜下半生的怀疑、软弱、焦虑的心灵财富。", "char_start": 1595, "char_end": 1661}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "祝你好运。", "char_start": 1662, "char_end": 1667}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 37}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0377"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么会有那么多人产后抑郁？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033"], "summary": "围绕“生育抑郁”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“产后抑郁、孕期抑郁，在很大程度上是一个社会问题，而不是一个简单的生理问题。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "产后抑郁、孕期抑郁，在很大程度上是一个社会问题，而不是一个简单的生理问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 37, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "647680b8-7d7a-5420-a49a-99b8ab31884b", "source_ordinal": 1473, "reading_ordinal": 2584, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "及格主义", "published_at": "2024-07-13T09:51:30+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/6d117aca40ba11efa9795254001e7c00"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "其实“一旦认识到自己的能力和资源足以达到目标就开始松懈、拖延”这个行为方式有一个前提，那就是认为“任务目标只需要达标、及格即可，更高的质量或者更快的完成速度没有意义，只是损失”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 89}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "我的任务是晚饭时间前准备好晚餐。我发现我还有时间、有多余的资源完成这个任务，我就先把这个任务放一放。", "char_start": 90, "char_end": 140}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这是因为我觉得晚餐无非是填饱你的肚子即可，我可以提前开始，投入更多的材料、心力去把晚餐做到高于这个水平，但是这个超出的水平我没有把握你会欣赏，也没有把握你会给我额外的回报。我也没有动力提前用最短的时间做好，因为由此省下的时间我也没啥别的用——尤其是我省下了时间，往往只意味着有别的累人的东西会被塞给我。", "char_start": 141, "char_end": 292}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "我要是一直奉行“尽快完成”策略，我的客观体验是我会过一种更疲劳、但却并没有成比例提升享受的人生，这对我就是一种损失。", "char_start": 293, "char_end": 351}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "到这里为止，“提前且超标准完成任务”的好处就都消失了，就会自然而然的导致“既然还有时间就再拖一拖”、“既然还有余力就不要慌”的“及格主义”逻辑。", "char_start": 352, "char_end": 424}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "人就总是在向“如何最省力的完成勉强刚好及格的结果”努力，而不是“如何在有效时间内完成尽可能好的结果”努力。", "char_start": 425, "char_end": 478}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "只有后者，才不会导致“情况乐观”与“丧失动力”直接相关。", "char_start": 479, "char_end": 507}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "现在的问题是，你为什么会沉迷于及格主义？", "char_start": 508, "char_end": 528}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "事实上，及格主义也不是没有价值——它自动的保证在缺少回报的目标上不会耗费过多的资源。", "char_start": 529, "char_end": 571}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "但这些节省下来的资源流向了何方？", "char_start": 572, "char_end": 588}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "如果是流向了一个你确信做得好就会有相称的丰厚的回报的事业领域，你在别处“只要乐观就会消极”所节省下来的动力就会在你的这个主领域全部被投入进去，作出令你筋疲力竭但足以代表你的极限巅峰的作品。", "char_start": 589, "char_end": 683}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "问题是，大多数人是将“及格主义”所节省下来的精力投入到了一个毫无产出的黑洞——感官享乐。", "char_start": 684, "char_end": 728}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你没有事业，没有一个会让你觉得“全力以赴，看看我的极限在哪”的东西来救赎你在其他一切方面的“及格就好”。", "char_start": 729, "char_end": 781}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "如果只有感官享乐，那么感官享乐最后会导致你在所有的方面都走向及格主义，把每一分“额外的质量”“额外的速度”都视为一种浪费。", "char_start": 782, "char_end": 843}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "如果你真的打算解决这个问题，你需要一个能让你直接享受过程的热爱。这个产品能卖钱只是额外的收益，仅仅是把全部激情都放到创造它的过程中就足够享受了，这样的东西，只要有一样，就可以救赎你全部的及格主义。", "char_start": 844, "char_end": 942}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "而且你本来就可以大面积的搞及格主义，这是正常现象，是健康的常态。真正不健康的，是你没有把大部分科目上的及格主义所省下的精力用在某个让你充满激情和享乐的创造和生产性科目上。", "char_start": 943, "char_end": 1028}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你要解决的是这个“生产性项目的缺失”的问题，远超过“及格主义泛滥”的问题。", "char_start": 1029, "char_end": 1066}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 17}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0377"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何避免对自己的能力和现状认知过于乐观以致丧失动力？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017"], "summary": "围绕“及格主义”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“其实“一旦认识到自己的能力和资源足以达到目标就开始松懈、拖延”这个行为方式有一个前提，那就是认为“任务目标只需要达标、及格即可，更高的质量或者更快的完成速度没有意义，只是损失”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "其实“一旦认识到自己的能力和资源足以达到目标就开始松懈、拖延”这个行为方式有一个前提，那就是认为“任务目标只需要达标、及格即可，更高的质量或者更快的完成速度没有意义，只是损失”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 89, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
